{"id":"82c784c7ecf8f649","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-proper-basis-jump.md","title":"特殊类内的跳跃反演","display":"thm-proper-basis-jump — 特殊类内的跳跃反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-proper-basis-jump","aliases":["20-thm-proper-basis-jump"],"display":"thm-proper-basis-jump — 特殊类内的跳跃反演","chapter":"9","section":"9.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.7.1","source_pdf_pages":[214],"source_printed_pages":[182],"depends_on":["[[20-df-special-class]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-thm-low-basis]]","[[20-thm-special-class-perfect]]","[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-proper-basis-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-proper-basis-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-proper-basis-jump — 特殊类内的跳跃反演"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.7.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>182</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3bd2a42af0edd0d9\" href=\"?note=3bd2a42af0edd0d9\" title=\"20-thm-special-class-perfect\">20-thm-special-class-perfect</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Special}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\">\\(C=[T]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3bd2a42af0edd0d9\" href=\"?note=3bd2a42af0edd0d9\" title=\"20-thm-special-class-perfect\">20-thm-special-class-perfect</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}basis\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [X&#39;\\equiv_TX\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\equiv_TA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}basis\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [X&#39;\\equiv_TX\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\equiv_TA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归构造无限可计算树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=T_0\\supseteq T_1\\supseteq\\cdots\">\\(T=T_0\\supseteq T_1\\supseteq\\cdots\\)</span>，但指标序列允许由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 计算。在偶步骤 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2e\">\\(2e\\)</span>，按 Low Basis 的修剪决定第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个跳跃位。在奇步骤 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2e+1\">\\(2e+1\\)</span>，当前非空类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T_{2e+1}]\\subseteq C\">\\([T_{2e+1}]\\subseteq C\\)</span> 仍特殊，故没有孤立点。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 的可延伸判定找到规范的两条不兼容可延伸串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0,\\sigma_1\">\\(\\sigma_0,\\sigma_1\\)</span>，使首个不同位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 分别为 0、1；限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{A(e)}\">\\(\\sigma_{A(e)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每一步保留非空闭类，紧致性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 属于全部类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 计算树指标序列及全部偶步骤的决定，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;\\le_T A\">\\(X&#39;\\le_T A\\)</span>。反向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 从初始树逐步重建：偶步骤用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 判断；奇步骤用同样规范搜索找串对，再读 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(x)\">\\(X(x)\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(e)\">\\(A(e)\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。一般跳跃性质给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\le_T X&#39;\">\\(X\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\le_T X&#39;\\)</span>，三项互相可约。</p>\n<p>特殊性供给每次编码分裂；若改为任意含可计算孤立点的闭类，此推导不能照用。寻找分裂的 oracle 与读取编码位的 oracle 在证明中分别明确。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.7.1；印刷 182 / PDF 214。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-basis","status":"resolved","id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":""